WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.750
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.020 --> 01:48.030
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.050 --> 01:51.080
[Episode 16]

4
02:04.850 --> 02:06.230
Did he come to see me

5
02:06.560 --> 02:08.300
just to return my scarf?

6
02:08.710 --> 02:10.690
Why does he

7
02:10.690 --> 02:12.090
seem a little impatient?

8
02:18.360 --> 02:18.910
Hello?

9
02:18.910 --> 02:19.710
What's up?

10
02:19.710 --> 02:20.520
Hello, Li.

11
02:20.680 --> 02:22.079
Did you guys meet?

12
02:22.079 --> 02:23.150
Did you give her the gift?

13
02:23.150 --> 02:24.120
Did everything go smoothly?

14
02:24.120 --> 02:25.750
I'm really annoyed right now.

15
02:25.750 --> 02:26.470
Can you stop bombarding me

16
02:26.470 --> 02:28.020
with questions?

17
02:28.270 --> 02:29.680
What's wrong with you?

18
02:31.520 --> 02:32.250
Nothing.

19
02:33.840 --> 02:35.020
Are you in a bad mood?

20
02:36.090 --> 02:37.840
Weren't you meeting Yunyi

21
02:37.840 --> 02:39.100
and her brother today?

22
02:39.810 --> 02:41.470
It has nothing to do with that.

23
02:41.870 --> 02:42.870
Yunyi got the gift

24
02:42.870 --> 02:43.520
you sent her,

25
02:43.520 --> 02:44.920
and she was really happy.

26
02:44.960 --> 02:45.520
If that's all,

27
02:45.520 --> 02:46.410
I'm hanging up.

28
02:46.710 --> 02:47.910
Wait, one more thing.

29
02:48.410 --> 02:49.470
The robotics competition

30
02:49.470 --> 02:51.120
is tomorrow, right?

31
02:51.650 --> 02:52.870
There's a problem

32
02:52.870 --> 02:54.120
I just can't figure out.

33
02:54.120 --> 02:55.590
Can you ask that guy

34
02:55.590 --> 02:56.960
from XUST for me?

35
02:58.060 --> 02:59.590
Why do you want me to ask him?

36
02:59.760 --> 03:01.620
Who else am I supposed to ask? You?

37
03:01.680 --> 03:02.470
I'm trying to give you

38
03:02.470 --> 03:03.650
a chance here.

39
03:03.810 --> 03:04.650
You have him on WeChat.

40
03:04.650 --> 03:05.650
Ask him yourself.

41
03:09.210 --> 03:09.960
Unbelievable! I try to help,

42
03:09.960 --> 03:11.690
and you throw it back in my face!

43
03:27.340 --> 03:28.000
Yun Ye,

44
03:28.500 --> 03:29.150
what's up?

45
03:29.180 --> 03:29.840
Hey, Shize.

46
03:30.000 --> 03:30.460
I have a robotics competition

47
03:30.460 --> 03:31.910
at the Science and Technology Festival tomorrow,

48
03:31.910 --> 03:32.650
and there's something

49
03:32.650 --> 03:33.460
about my robot

50
03:33.460 --> 03:34.620
I wanted to ask you.

51
03:34.620 --> 03:35.310
Go ahead.

52
03:35.680 --> 03:36.800
It's the gait

53
03:36.800 --> 03:37.860
and posture control.

54
03:37.860 --> 03:38.800
It keeps being unstable.

55
03:38.800 --> 03:40.020
I've adjusted it over and over

56
03:40.020 --> 03:41.020
according to the manual,

57
03:41.020 --> 03:41.860
but it's still not working.

58
03:41.860 --> 03:43.020
Do you think it's a parameter issue

59
03:43.020 --> 03:45.079
or a problem with the control system?

60
03:46.050 --> 03:47.250
For posture control,

61
03:48.020 --> 03:49.180
check the calibration

62
03:49.180 --> 03:51.079
of the gyroscope and accelerometer,

63
03:51.079 --> 03:52.210
as well as the PID parameters.

64
03:52.210 --> 03:53.750
See if they need fine-tuning.

65
03:53.750 --> 03:54.970
If that doesn't work,

66
03:55.460 --> 03:56.280
there might be a balancing issue

67
03:56.280 --> 03:57.250
with the motor

68
03:57.250 --> 03:58.650
or transmission system.

69
03:58.650 --> 03:59.470
Check for any wear

70
03:59.470 --> 04:00.970
or deformation.

71
04:01.150 --> 04:02.310
I'll give that a try.

72
04:02.410 --> 04:03.470
Thanks, Shize!

73
04:03.620 --> 04:04.910
You're seriously amazing.

74
04:04.910 --> 04:05.590
Oh, by the way,

75
04:05.590 --> 04:06.620
isn't the handmade drone

76
04:06.620 --> 04:08.370
my sister gave you super cool?

77
04:09.460 --> 04:10.190
I bet

78
04:10.190 --> 04:11.530
she stayed up all night

79
04:11.550 --> 04:12.770
making that drone.

80
04:15.280 --> 04:17.480
The drone your sister gave me?

81
04:17.560 --> 04:18.250
Yeah.

82
04:19.620 --> 04:21.620
Wait, she hasn't given it to you yet?

83
04:23.920 --> 04:24.480
Shize,

84
04:24.480 --> 04:25.370
please pretend

85
04:25.370 --> 04:26.330
this never happened,

86
04:26.330 --> 04:28.270
or my sister will kill me!

87
04:31.220 --> 04:32.920
I'll let you go now, Shize.

88
04:33.159 --> 04:34.010
Thanks!

89
04:35.770 --> 04:36.950
Yun Li,

90
04:37.250 --> 04:39.070
why are you taking so long to give it to him?

91
04:39.070 --> 04:40.400
Well, it's not my fault.

92
04:48.440 --> 04:49.250
Mrs. Jiang.

93
04:49.750 --> 04:50.770
How is Grandma?

94
04:51.420 --> 04:52.220
There you are.

95
04:53.620 --> 04:55.620
She really gave us a scare this time.

96
04:56.130 --> 04:57.659
Your uncle stayed by her side for two days

97
04:57.659 --> 04:58.930
and was completely worn out,

98
04:58.930 --> 05:00.790
so I sent him home to get some rest.

99
05:01.450 --> 05:02.250
Did the doctor say

100
05:02.250 --> 05:03.560
what caused it?

101
05:03.870 --> 05:05.070
I won't know

102
05:05.070 --> 05:06.010
until the test results

103
05:06.010 --> 05:07.130
come back.

104
05:08.860 --> 05:10.100
Keep an eye on her for me.

105
05:10.100 --> 05:11.060
I'm going

106
05:11.060 --> 05:12.300
to get the test results.

107
05:12.300 --> 05:13.230
Okay, Ms. Jiang.

108
05:14.130 --> 05:16.060
Ring the bell if you need anything.

109
05:21.040 --> 05:21.540
Hello?

110
05:22.310 --> 05:23.010
Uncle,

111
05:23.120 --> 05:24.250
tell Lili

112
05:24.360 --> 05:25.720
I took care of it for her.

113
05:26.230 --> 05:27.290
I'm busy right now.

114
05:27.990 --> 05:29.140
Tell her yourself.

115
05:31.170 --> 05:31.990
Yuanyuan.

116
05:32.720 --> 05:33.360
Grandma.

117
05:33.560 --> 05:35.950
Do you have something urgent to take care of?

118
05:35.950 --> 05:37.450
No, I'm fine.

119
05:38.750 --> 05:39.510
If you have things to do,

120
05:39.510 --> 05:40.800
go ahead.

121
05:41.100 --> 05:42.100
It's okay.

122
05:43.100 --> 05:45.159
That's just how it is when you get old.

123
05:45.500 --> 05:46.860
Something's bothering you one moment,

124
05:46.860 --> 05:48.460
and something else the next.

125
05:48.620 --> 05:49.690
It's nothing.

126
05:50.620 --> 05:51.420
You don't have

127
05:51.420 --> 05:53.220
to stay here with me all the time.

128
05:54.860 --> 05:55.659
Grandma,

129
05:56.010 --> 05:57.670
just focus on getting better.

130
05:58.310 --> 05:59.970
I have nothing to take care of.

131
06:00.890 --> 06:01.690
All right.

132
06:01.930 --> 06:02.430
Come on,

133
06:03.510 --> 06:04.360
let's get you covered up.

134
06:04.360 --> 06:05.220
Get some sleep.

135
06:07.100 --> 06:07.890
Okay.

136
06:08.890 --> 06:09.690
Alright.

137
06:10.890 --> 06:11.690
Go to sleep.

138
06:12.130 --> 06:13.460
I'll stay here with you.

139
06:28.290 --> 06:29.090
Yun Li, Yun Li!

140
06:30.100 --> 06:30.890
What is it?

141
06:31.620 --> 06:32.500
You have no idea

142
06:32.600 --> 06:34.600
what a big deal happened yesterday!

143
06:35.120 --> 06:36.000
What happened?

144
06:36.420 --> 06:37.450
I never thought

145
06:37.480 --> 06:39.090
Du Gefei would get what was coming to her.

146
06:39.090 --> 06:40.880
It's so satisfying!

147
06:41.300 --> 06:42.810
Mr. Xu's younger brother was incredible.

148
06:42.810 --> 06:44.500
He put her firmly in her place.

149
06:45.510 --> 06:46.510
Congratulations!

150
06:46.510 --> 06:48.500
You've finally been vindicated.

151
06:48.500 --> 06:49.060
Wait,

152
06:49.090 --> 06:50.170
whose younger brother?

153
06:50.170 --> 06:51.970
What happened with Fu Zhengchu?

154
06:52.300 --> 06:53.159
Yesterday, Mr. Xu's younger brother

155
06:53.159 --> 06:54.250
exposed

156
06:54.250 --> 06:55.620
Du Gefei for smearing you in her online posts,

157
06:55.620 --> 06:57.250
right in front of everyone!

158
06:58.100 --> 06:59.630
You have to watch the video.

159
06:59.890 --> 07:01.750
It's already been posted online,

160
07:01.920 --> 07:03.850
and people are all calling her out.

161
07:04.160 --> 07:05.560
I sincerely apologize.

162
07:07.060 --> 07:09.220
All the allegations I posted about Idle Cloud

163
07:09.220 --> 07:10.690
were fabricated.

164
07:11.500 --> 07:12.800
Please stop believing

165
07:12.820 --> 07:13.950
and spreading them.

166
07:14.300 --> 07:15.120
I'd like

167
07:15.510 --> 07:17.710
to apologize to Idle Cloud personally.

168
07:25.310 --> 07:26.120
Fu Zhengchu,

169
07:26.920 --> 07:28.720
try some of my homemade cookies.

170
07:29.510 --> 07:30.040
Okay.

171
07:32.490 --> 07:33.290
Fu Zhengchu,

172
07:33.430 --> 07:34.690
thank you. Seriously.

173
07:36.310 --> 07:37.070
You don't have

174
07:37.070 --> 07:37.540
to thank me, Lili.

175
07:37.540 --> 07:38.130
You've said thank you

176
07:38.130 --> 07:38.830
like 800 times already.

177
07:38.830 --> 07:39.430
J-Just

178
07:39.430 --> 07:40.220
one last time.

179
07:40.220 --> 07:40.540
Really,

180
07:40.540 --> 07:41.330
if it weren't for you,

181
07:41.330 --> 07:43.370
I wouldn't have been able to prove my innocence.

182
07:43.370 --> 07:44.070
Honestly,

183
07:44.070 --> 07:45.270
it was no big deal.

184
07:45.480 --> 07:46.630
This kind of thing

185
07:46.630 --> 07:48.430
is a piece of cake for me.

186
07:48.510 --> 07:49.270
I may have had

187
07:49.270 --> 07:50.480
to use a little of my charm,

188
07:50.480 --> 07:51.770
but that's no big deal

189
07:52.120 --> 07:53.580
for a handsome guy like me.

190
07:53.630 --> 07:54.310
You sure have

191
07:54.310 --> 07:55.840
a high opinion of yourself.

192
07:56.620 --> 07:58.180
It's not that you're charming.

193
07:58.180 --> 07:59.770
She's just easy to impress.

194
08:00.430 --> 08:01.070
Tang Lin,

195
08:01.070 --> 08:01.570
did you swallow

196
08:01.570 --> 08:02.480
some medicated oil or something?

197
08:02.480 --> 08:03.740
Why do you always have to make snide remarks?

198
08:03.740 --> 08:04.870
If you'd seen

199
08:04.870 --> 08:06.980
my brilliant performance that night,

200
08:06.980 --> 08:08.580
you'd have thought I was 007.

201
08:10.120 --> 08:11.320
But seriously, Lili,

202
08:11.510 --> 08:12.620
if you really want to thank someone,

203
08:12.620 --> 08:13.310
you should thank—

204
08:13.310 --> 08:13.830
Enough!

205
08:15.180 --> 08:16.630
Even a blind squirrel finds a nut once in a while,

206
08:16.630 --> 08:18.490
and now you're bragging about it.

207
08:18.510 --> 08:19.240
Lili, let's go.

208
08:19.240 --> 08:20.500
Let's get back inside.

209
08:22.860 --> 08:23.560
What's that about?

210
08:23.560 --> 08:24.890
I wasn't even finished.

211
08:27.770 --> 08:28.570
Tangy.

212
08:30.830 --> 08:31.720
What's wrong?

213
08:32.870 --> 08:33.980
Still upset?

214
08:37.120 --> 08:39.120
Regretting throwing up too soon that night?

215
08:39.120 --> 08:41.030
I told you not to drink so much.

216
08:44.010 --> 08:45.140
I've made up my mind.

217
08:45.220 --> 08:46.480
I'm done pursuing him.

218
08:47.890 --> 08:48.240
B-But

219
08:48.240 --> 08:50.840
you know it was all a misunderstanding, right?

220
08:50.980 --> 08:52.780
It's got nothing to do with that.

221
08:53.630 --> 08:55.670
Actually, after I drank too much that night,

222
08:55.670 --> 08:57.530
I thought about it for a long time.

223
08:58.240 --> 08:59.460
Maybe I'm just tired.

224
09:03.130 --> 09:04.030
He's like a stone

225
09:04.030 --> 09:05.530
that no amount of warmth can ever heat up.

226
09:05.530 --> 09:07.240
I've laid all my affection

227
09:07.240 --> 09:08.620
at his feet,

228
09:08.940 --> 09:10.000
but what about him?

229
09:10.480 --> 09:11.840
He's still laughing and joking every day,

230
09:11.840 --> 09:13.720
completely carefree, like nothing matters.

231
09:13.720 --> 09:14.740
A good relationship

232
09:14.740 --> 09:16.480
should be a two-way street,

233
09:16.870 --> 09:18.340
not a one-woman show,

234
09:18.750 --> 09:19.320
right?

235
09:20.840 --> 09:22.670
But if you give up just like that,

236
09:22.670 --> 09:24.170
won't you regret it?

237
09:25.480 --> 09:26.270
I think

238
09:26.270 --> 09:27.200
if you

239
09:27.650 --> 09:29.130
really like someone,

240
09:29.720 --> 09:31.530
you should hang in there a little longer

241
09:31.530 --> 09:33.120
and give it another shot.

242
09:33.670 --> 09:34.440
At least

243
09:34.440 --> 09:36.370
get a clear answer from him, right?

244
09:37.820 --> 09:39.770
Even if you hit a brick wall,

245
09:40.170 --> 09:41.220
at least you'll know you tried.

246
09:41.220 --> 09:43.020
Then you won't have any regrets.

247
09:45.840 --> 09:46.530
But

248
09:47.170 --> 09:48.770
maybe letting go

249
09:48.770 --> 09:50.170
is the right thing for me.

250
09:50.870 --> 09:51.770
At least I won't have

251
09:51.770 --> 09:53.080
to keep worrying about where I stand with him every day.

252
09:53.080 --> 09:54.370
I won't have to keep staring at my phone,

253
09:54.370 --> 09:55.820
waiting for his messages.

254
09:55.820 --> 09:56.580
And I won't be

255
09:56.580 --> 09:57.980
so hung up

256
09:57.980 --> 09:59.910
on every little change in his mood.

257
10:05.530 --> 10:07.270
But don't let my experience influence you.

258
10:07.270 --> 10:08.740
Your situation is different from mine.

259
10:08.740 --> 10:10.080
It's okay, Tangy.

260
10:10.080 --> 10:10.720
Really,

261
10:10.720 --> 10:11.980
I'll support

262
10:12.120 --> 10:13.320
whatever you decide.

263
10:13.740 --> 10:14.670
I just want you

264
10:14.670 --> 10:16.370
to always be

265
10:16.370 --> 10:18.440
that happy Tangy without a care in the world.

266
10:18.440 --> 10:19.130
Seriously,

267
10:19.510 --> 10:20.320
if you're feeling down,

268
10:20.320 --> 10:21.370
I'll go out for drinks with you

269
10:21.370 --> 10:22.030
right now.

270
10:22.030 --> 10:22.500
No,

271
10:23.650 --> 10:25.110
I'm never drinking again.

272
10:28.580 --> 10:30.030
Honestly, I admire you.

273
10:30.480 --> 10:31.290
You might think

274
10:31.290 --> 10:31.940
I'm an extrovert,

275
10:31.940 --> 10:33.740
but sometimes I'm such a coward.

276
10:34.120 --> 10:35.630
You're different, though.

277
10:35.630 --> 10:38.830
You're timid in little things, but brave when it matters.

278
10:41.940 --> 10:43.130
How are things going with Fu Shize?

279
10:43.130 --> 10:44.930
Have you given him the drone yet?

280
10:44.980 --> 10:45.910
Not yet.

281
10:46.740 --> 10:48.460
He returned my scarf,

282
10:48.670 --> 10:50.730
and we haven't seen each other since.

283
10:51.530 --> 10:53.060
Be a little more proactive.

284
11:04.890 --> 11:05.770
Here, Grandma.

285
11:09.940 --> 11:10.740
Is it too hot?

286
11:11.720 --> 11:12.520
No, it's fine.

287
11:13.670 --> 11:14.550
Just right.

288
11:27.370 --> 11:28.080
Shize,

289
11:28.320 --> 11:29.530
the engineering prototype has arrived.

290
11:29.530 --> 11:31.260
We'll test it when you get back.

291
11:31.720 --> 11:32.410
Got it.

292
11:34.100 --> 11:34.700
By the way,

293
11:35.650 --> 11:36.650
is there anything

294
11:37.440 --> 11:38.340
on my desk?

295
11:38.370 --> 11:39.170
Let me check.

296
11:42.370 --> 11:43.100
There are...

297
11:43.810 --> 11:44.640
just a few books.

298
11:44.640 --> 11:45.550
Nothing else.

299
12:03.130 --> 12:03.820
Hi, Yun Li.

300
12:05.340 --> 12:05.940
I'm off.

301
12:32.660 --> 12:35.930
[Inpatient]

302
13:02.410 --> 13:03.610
Why don't you come in?

303
13:04.740 --> 13:06.440
I just wanted to see Grandma.

304
13:06.510 --> 13:07.910
Since she's resting,

305
13:07.910 --> 13:09.050
I won't go in.

306
13:16.840 --> 13:17.630
Maybe

307
13:18.510 --> 13:20.340
it's better if I stay away?

308
13:21.320 --> 13:21.980
Grandma probably

309
13:21.980 --> 13:24.180
doesn't remember me anymore, does she?

310
13:26.320 --> 13:28.180
Does she still think you're Yuan?

311
13:34.580 --> 13:35.370
By the way,

312
13:35.910 --> 13:38.240
the school lab was renovated a while back,

313
13:38.370 --> 13:39.130
and your drone

314
13:39.130 --> 13:40.260
is still at my place.

315
13:40.510 --> 13:42.570
I'll bring it to you next time we meet.

316
13:45.170 --> 13:46.240
Just keep it.

317
13:46.870 --> 13:47.720
As a keepsake.

318
13:50.580 --> 13:52.220
I used to think the same way.

319
13:52.870 --> 13:53.670
But now, I don't think

320
13:53.670 --> 13:55.270
any of that matters anymore.

321
13:56.580 --> 13:58.030
What truly matters

322
13:58.620 --> 14:00.820
has already found a place in our hearts,

323
14:00.840 --> 14:01.630
hasn't it?

324
14:08.840 --> 14:10.440
I had a dream the other night.

325
14:12.030 --> 14:14.030
In it, we'd graduated with our PhDs.

326
14:15.910 --> 14:17.030
I talked to Yuan

327
14:17.030 --> 14:18.960
about so many things in that dream,

328
14:19.770 --> 14:20.870
but I never told him the one thing

329
14:20.870 --> 14:22.220
that mattered most.

330
14:26.410 --> 14:27.530
Later, I found out

331
14:28.740 --> 14:30.670
that Yuan had feelings for me, too.

332
14:31.870 --> 14:32.270
And because

333
14:32.270 --> 14:34.130
of one little misunderstanding,

334
14:34.940 --> 14:36.530
we missed our chance.

335
14:38.320 --> 14:39.910
That's when I realized that

336
14:40.340 --> 14:42.340
what you see isn't always the truth.

337
14:44.340 --> 14:45.080
If only I'd

338
14:45.080 --> 14:45.840
cleared things up

339
14:45.080 --> 14:47.170
with Yuan back then,

340
14:49.080 --> 14:51.480
would things have turned out differently?

341
15:10.980 --> 15:11.770
I'm sorry.

342
15:14.530 --> 15:15.320
Shize,

343
15:15.720 --> 15:17.250
it's really not your fault.

344
15:17.980 --> 15:19.220
Let's leave the past

345
15:19.620 --> 15:21.270
in the past.

346
15:30.720 --> 15:31.920
I'd better get going.

347
16:31.940 --> 16:33.670
Actually, the truth is out now.

348
16:35.910 --> 16:37.310
You don't have to resign.

349
16:38.340 --> 16:39.400
Do you really think

350
16:40.740 --> 16:42.630
I can stay here after all this?

351
16:46.370 --> 16:47.480
I can't stand

352
16:47.480 --> 16:49.530
people looking at me differently.

353
16:55.390 --> 16:56.150
Yun Li,

354
16:58.720 --> 16:59.530
I'm sorry.

355
17:01.700 --> 17:03.180
I hope you can forgive me.

356
17:09.640 --> 17:10.440
Goodbye.

357
17:34.140 --> 17:34.720
Hello?

358
17:34.990 --> 17:36.480
Hey, I haven't been at the office for the past couple of days.

359
17:36.480 --> 17:37.810
Is there anything I need to take care of?

360
17:37.810 --> 17:38.610
No, nothing.

361
17:39.220 --> 17:40.310
The company's been quiet while you've been away.

362
17:40.310 --> 17:41.770
Nothing major has come up.

363
17:41.920 --> 17:43.850
Is Grandma ready to be discharged?

364
17:45.310 --> 17:46.110
That's good.

365
17:47.110 --> 17:48.510
Let me ask you something.

366
17:48.680 --> 17:50.940
If you wanted to ask a girl out for dinner,

367
17:51.330 --> 17:52.830
what kind of restaurant would you choose?

368
17:52.830 --> 17:54.760
You're asking a girl out to dinner?

369
17:55.610 --> 17:56.920
Did I hear that right?

370
17:58.510 --> 17:59.310
Shize,

371
17:59.810 --> 18:01.330
you've finally caught on.

372
18:01.770 --> 18:02.570
Oh, cut it out.

373
18:03.240 --> 18:04.840
Just help me figure this out.

374
18:16.070 --> 18:16.740
Jiang,

375
18:17.770 --> 18:18.530
Mom's back.

376
18:18.530 --> 18:19.190
She's back.

377
18:19.240 --> 18:19.810
Grandma,

378
18:20.110 --> 18:21.750
you should head inside first.

379
18:21.750 --> 18:22.510
Yuan,

380
18:22.830 --> 18:24.160
aren't you coming home?

381
18:29.140 --> 18:30.480
Come in and sit for a while.

382
18:30.480 --> 18:31.280
No, Ms. Jiang.

383
18:32.030 --> 18:34.110
I have something to take care of later.

384
18:34.110 --> 18:34.920
Yuan,

385
18:36.830 --> 18:38.360
take good care of yourself.

386
18:39.330 --> 18:40.590
Don't worry, Grandma.

387
18:40.870 --> 18:42.910
♪ The dusk settles slow ♪

388
18:41.420 --> 18:42.930
I'll head back first, then.

389
18:42.930 --> 18:45.940
♪ Too faint of heart to follow through ♪

390
18:43.610 --> 18:44.220
Watch your step.

391
18:44.220 --> 18:45.150
Watch your step.

392
18:48.000 --> 18:50.000
♪ It's grown like a habit ♪

393
18:50.020 --> 18:53.020
♪ Awaiting dark clouds to spread ♪

394
18:55.480 --> 18:57.640
♪ Fear promises are shallow ♪

395
18:59.130 --> 19:01.130
♪ No match for the tides of change ♪

396
19:01.530 --> 19:02.880
I heard Engineer Fu is going

397
19:02.740 --> 19:07.150
♪ Let rain soak all that once was ours ♪

398
19:02.880 --> 19:05.140
on a date with a girl he's known for years.

399
19:07.030 --> 19:08.180
Fu Shize?

400
19:08.770 --> 19:09.680
Surprised?

401
19:10.030 --> 19:11.240
No wonder he's always been

402
19:11.240 --> 19:12.680
so unapproachable at work.

403
19:12.680 --> 19:15.410
Turns out he's had someone in his heart all along.

404
19:16.510 --> 19:17.590
I even thought

405
19:17.590 --> 19:18.720
you two were dating.

406
19:20.810 --> 19:21.480
Then...

407
19:22.180 --> 19:23.710
with someone as cold as him,

408
19:23.880 --> 19:26.070
what kind of girl does he like?

409
19:26.510 --> 19:28.030
I don't know the details.

410
19:28.530 --> 19:31.180
But I heard she's really pretty,

411
19:31.310 --> 19:32.430
has a great personality,

412
19:32.430 --> 19:33.600
and is very capable.

413
19:33.620 --> 19:35.820
They're a perfect match for each other.

414
19:37.440 --> 19:38.440
I didn't expect

415
19:38.740 --> 19:40.420
Engineer Fu to be so devoted.

416
19:43.740 --> 19:45.680
N-No way, right?

417
19:46.420 --> 19:48.440
Guess even he can fall in love!

418
19:49.030 --> 19:50.610
But I'm curious, too.

419
19:50.920 --> 19:52.810
Does it really take someone like him

420
19:52.810 --> 19:53.810
this long

421
19:54.070 --> 19:55.640
to win a girl over?

422
19:59.890 --> 20:03.170
I heard you're going on a date with someone.

423
20:04.370 --> 20:06.190
♪ A thin short line ♪

424
20:06.210 --> 20:09.830
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

425
20:06.700 --> 20:08.590
You're a wonderful person.

426
20:08.790 --> 20:09.850
Thank you

427
20:09.850 --> 20:11.640
for always taking care of me.

428
20:11.560 --> 20:13.560
♪ Which way to go ♪

429
20:11.790 --> 20:12.740
Maybe

430
20:12.810 --> 20:14.770
I have no right to say this,

431
20:13.850 --> 20:16.830
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

432
20:14.940 --> 20:16.050
but I hope

433
20:16.050 --> 20:17.640
you'll take better care of yourself.

434
20:17.640 --> 20:19.940
You're the best person I've ever known,

435
20:18.870 --> 20:20.620
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

436
20:20.030 --> 20:22.030
and you deserve the best.

437
20:20.640 --> 20:24.640
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

438
20:22.240 --> 20:24.290
I heard you've met someone you like.

439
20:24.420 --> 20:25.750
Thank you for coming into my life.

440
20:25.710 --> 20:31.010
♪ Hesitant feet—which side should I stand on ♪

441
20:26.590 --> 20:28.120
I won't bother you anymore.

442
20:33.510 --> 20:36.190
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

443
20:36.210 --> 20:37.800
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

444
20:37.820 --> 20:39.630
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

445
20:39.650 --> 20:42.620
♪ This damp murmur ♪

446
20:42.910 --> 20:47.380
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

447
20:45.930 --> 20:48.130
[Delete Contact]

448
20:48.040 --> 20:51.390
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

449
20:51.550 --> 20:54.540
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

450
20:55.070 --> 21:00.410
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

451
21:00.590 --> 21:02.280
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

452
21:02.310 --> 21:05.830
♪ Maybe someday ♪

453
21:05.850 --> 21:08.450
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

454
21:08.790 --> 21:15.500
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

455
21:15.520 --> 21:25.770
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

456
21:37.480 --> 21:38.070
Hello?

457
21:38.320 --> 21:39.140
I've got the restaurant

458
21:39.140 --> 21:40.310
sorted out for you.

459
21:40.380 --> 21:41.240
Let me tell you,

460
21:41.380 --> 21:42.770
I asked a ton of people

461
21:42.830 --> 21:44.680
before finally settling on this place.

462
21:44.680 --> 21:46.210
I'll send you the location.

463
21:47.450 --> 21:48.630
[Skyline Bistro]

464
21:50.330 --> 21:51.310
Skyline Bistro?

465
21:51.810 --> 21:52.610
It's on the top floor

466
21:52.610 --> 21:54.220
of Tianqi Mall.

467
21:54.380 --> 21:55.420
The food is great,

468
21:55.510 --> 21:57.030
but the view is even better.

469
21:57.030 --> 21:57.740
You can take in

470
21:57.740 --> 21:59.330
the entire city of Nanwu at night.

471
21:59.330 --> 22:01.420
It's the perfect place to take a girl on a date.

472
22:01.420 --> 22:02.680
Just imagine it.

473
22:03.070 --> 22:04.610
You two can eat and chat,

474
22:04.740 --> 22:06.330
growing closer

475
22:06.530 --> 22:08.240
as you gaze at the moon together.

476
22:08.240 --> 22:09.530
Once you've had enough of the moon,

477
22:09.530 --> 22:11.440
just look down

478
22:11.660 --> 22:12.770
at a sea

479
22:13.570 --> 22:15.480
of lights stretching across the city.

480
22:15.480 --> 22:17.140
It couldn't be more romantic!

481
22:19.350 --> 22:20.180
Xu Qingsong,

482
22:22.110 --> 22:23.310
what should I prepare

483
22:23.870 --> 22:25.070
for a date with a girl?

484
22:25.940 --> 22:26.740
What a waste

485
22:26.740 --> 22:28.470
of that handsome face of yours!

486
22:28.700 --> 22:29.220
You've made it this far in life

487
22:29.220 --> 22:30.720
without any dating experience.

488
22:30.720 --> 22:32.140
It's not that complicated.

489
22:32.140 --> 22:34.310
Flowers, beautiful scenery, and little gifts.

490
22:34.310 --> 22:35.030
Of course,

491
22:35.030 --> 22:36.490
she has to be into you, too.

492
22:36.610 --> 22:39.410
Otherwise, nothing you do will make a difference.

493
22:39.980 --> 22:41.040
I think she might be

494
22:42.180 --> 22:43.310
a little into me.

495
22:44.240 --> 22:45.570
What makes you say that?

496
22:45.810 --> 22:47.380
That's none of your business.

497
22:47.380 --> 22:48.460
How is it none—

498
22:54.070 --> 22:55.270
You ungrateful jerk!

499
23:01.570 --> 23:07.980
[Are you free tomorrow? I know a nice restaurant. Would you like to go with me?]

500
23:11.740 --> 23:12.340
Forget it.

501
23:13.140 --> 23:14.470
I'll tell her in person.

502
23:35.140 --> 23:35.830
Hello!

503
23:35.980 --> 23:36.810
Welcome.

504
23:37.770 --> 23:38.880
What kind of flowers are you looking for?

505
23:38.880 --> 23:40.480
I can recommend some for you.

506
23:43.330 --> 23:44.140
I...

507
23:44.740 --> 23:46.330
Who are the flowers for?

508
23:46.330 --> 23:48.530
I can help you find something suitable.

509
23:50.330 --> 23:51.470
I want to give them

510
23:52.200 --> 23:53.800
to a girl who's been by my side

511
23:54.270 --> 23:54.920
for many years

512
23:54.920 --> 23:56.050
and means a lot to me.

513
23:58.640 --> 24:00.240
How about violets?

514
24:01.070 --> 24:02.380
They symbolize,

515
24:02.380 --> 24:03.740
"In a world you know nothing about,

516
24:03.740 --> 24:04.770
I'll love you

517
24:04.880 --> 24:06.080
until the end of time.

518
24:06.530 --> 24:07.530
I hope you're the one I begin with

519
24:07.530 --> 24:08.790
and the one I end with."

520
24:11.850 --> 24:13.480
Yeah, I'll take those.

521
24:14.380 --> 24:15.440
Great. No problem.

522
24:50.660 --> 24:53.120
I guess I won't be giving you to him after all.

523
25:31.140 --> 25:31.920
He already

524
25:31.920 --> 25:33.510
likes someone else.

525
25:34.030 --> 25:35.160
What's the point

526
25:35.160 --> 25:36.420
of adding him back now?

527
26:22.640 --> 26:23.750
Hello?

528
26:23.840 --> 26:25.220
Your flower delivery is here.

529
26:25.220 --> 26:25.980
Yes,

530
26:26.470 --> 26:27.050
that's right.

531
26:27.050 --> 26:28.380
I'm at the entrance now.

532
26:42.200 --> 26:44.500
Your number ends in 0237, and you're Mr. Fu, right?

533
26:44.500 --> 26:44.850
Great.

534
26:44.850 --> 26:46.450
Could you sign here, please?

535
26:52.100 --> 26:52.810
Here's your bouquet.

536
26:52.810 --> 26:53.500
Thank you.

537
26:57.030 --> 26:58.680
Does he have a date today?

538
26:58.790 --> 27:00.140
He even got a bouquet.

539
27:26.480 --> 27:27.280
Would you like

540
27:29.830 --> 27:30.960
to get coffee today?

541
27:33.910 --> 27:34.650
No, thanks!

542
28:00.740 --> 28:02.890
[Add to Contacts]

543
28:06.530 --> 28:08.070
He didn't even notice

544
28:08.070 --> 28:10.330
I'd removed him from my WeChat contacts.

545
28:19.330 --> 28:20.120
Hello?

546
28:20.310 --> 28:21.110
Hi,

547
28:21.310 --> 28:22.440
this is Yin Yucheng.

548
28:22.720 --> 28:23.310
Hi.

549
28:23.310 --> 28:24.720
What can I do for you?

550
28:25.070 --> 28:26.570
Could we meet up and talk?

551
28:27.060 --> 28:28.820
It's about Yun Ye and Yunyi.

552
28:29.420 --> 28:30.640
What's happened to them?

553
28:30.640 --> 28:31.270
It's a bit complicated

554
28:31.270 --> 28:32.220
to explain over the phone.

555
28:32.220 --> 28:33.350
Let's meet and talk.

556
28:34.680 --> 28:35.160
Okay.

557
28:36.510 --> 28:37.040
Bye-bye.

558
28:44.380 --> 28:45.180
Thank you.

559
28:45.610 --> 28:46.270
No problem.

560
28:48.010 --> 28:49.140
Would you like something to eat?

561
28:49.140 --> 28:49.680
No, thanks.

562
28:49.680 --> 28:51.810
I have to get back to work at the office soon.

563
28:51.810 --> 28:52.440
Senior,

564
28:52.440 --> 28:54.880
is there something you wanted to talk to me about?

565
28:54.880 --> 28:55.680
I'm sorry

566
28:55.880 --> 28:57.240
for asking you to meet me so suddenly.

567
28:57.240 --> 28:59.510
This might be a little awkward to talk about,

568
28:59.510 --> 29:00.980
but it's important,

569
29:01.010 --> 29:02.180
and I wanted you

570
29:02.330 --> 29:03.590
to be the first to know.

571
29:12.310 --> 29:14.610
Ever since Yunyi started boarding at school,

572
29:14.610 --> 29:15.380
I've been the one collecting the mail

573
29:15.380 --> 29:16.480
sent to our house.

574
29:16.480 --> 29:17.140
I noticed

575
29:17.140 --> 29:18.420
that ever since we moved to Nanwu,

576
29:18.420 --> 29:19.580
she's been getting postcards

577
29:19.580 --> 29:20.980
from her old classmates.

578
29:21.070 --> 29:22.220
About three a week.

579
29:22.220 --> 29:23.310
In less than a month,

580
29:23.310 --> 29:24.840
she's received almost ten.

581
29:25.640 --> 29:27.480
Yunyi must be pretty popular.

582
29:29.440 --> 29:32.070
The postcards are all signed by Class 15 of Grade 11,

583
29:32.070 --> 29:33.830
but I compared the handwriting,

584
29:33.830 --> 29:35.690
and it's identical on all of them.

585
29:37.480 --> 29:39.070
It's the same handwriting

586
29:39.360 --> 29:41.160
as on the gift box last time, too.

587
29:43.070 --> 29:44.530
Yun Ye...

588
29:44.660 --> 29:46.090
Unbelievable.

589
29:46.510 --> 29:47.830
If I'm not mistaken,

590
29:48.720 --> 29:50.580
Yun Ye must have written them all.

591
29:51.140 --> 29:52.270
That's what I think.

592
29:53.480 --> 29:54.880
Don't you want to read the letters?

593
29:54.880 --> 29:55.570
I'd rather not.

594
29:55.570 --> 29:57.770
I don't feel right reading his letters.

595
29:57.830 --> 29:59.490
You don't feel right about it?

596
30:00.140 --> 30:01.770
Well, they're private.

597
30:03.640 --> 30:05.270
There's nothing much in them, actually.

598
30:05.270 --> 30:05.680
Just simple

599
30:05.680 --> 30:07.750
greetings and words of encouragement.

600
30:07.750 --> 30:08.330
If it weren't

601
30:08.330 --> 30:09.480
affecting their studies,

602
30:09.480 --> 30:10.940
I wouldn't want to interfere, either.

603
30:10.940 --> 30:12.680
But kids that age

604
30:12.680 --> 30:13.980
can be fickle.

605
30:15.070 --> 30:17.030
Let's keep the lines of communication open.

606
30:17.030 --> 30:18.380
If you hear anything,

607
30:19.010 --> 30:19.980
give me a call anytime.

608
30:19.980 --> 30:20.240
Okay.

609
30:20.240 --> 30:21.970
I'll talk to him when I get back.

610
30:25.070 --> 30:25.510
Senior,

611
30:25.510 --> 30:27.850
there's just one thing I wanted to ask you.

612
30:28.160 --> 30:28.960
Go ahead.

613
30:29.610 --> 30:31.340
Has Yunyi

614
30:31.370 --> 30:33.510
ever written back to Yun Ye?

615
30:36.270 --> 30:37.220
I don't think so.

616
30:44.010 --> 30:45.480
Thanks for coming all this way.

617
30:45.480 --> 30:45.850
No problem.

618
30:45.850 --> 30:46.310
I'll have a serious talk with Yun Ye

619
30:46.310 --> 30:47.680
when I get back.

620
30:47.960 --> 30:50.960
You don't need to put too much pressure on him, either.

621
30:56.810 --> 30:57.310
Yun Li.

622
30:58.830 --> 30:59.770
Fu Shize.

623
31:01.880 --> 31:02.810
Long time no see.

624
31:02.920 --> 31:03.980
Do you remember me?

625
31:06.570 --> 31:07.900
You two know each other?

626
31:08.810 --> 31:09.790
We used to be captains

627
31:09.790 --> 31:11.170
of drone teams.

628
31:11.190 --> 31:12.720
We competed against each other several times.

629
31:12.720 --> 31:14.250
You could say we were old rivals.

630
31:14.250 --> 31:15.050
Rivals?

631
31:18.050 --> 31:19.310
I need to talk to Yun Li.

632
31:19.510 --> 31:20.500
And you are?

633
31:21.010 --> 31:21.610
We're—

634
31:21.610 --> 31:22.350
Coworkers.

635
31:23.920 --> 31:25.270
Y-You said you needed to talk to me, right?

636
31:25.270 --> 31:25.980
Let's go.

637
31:26.010 --> 31:27.340
Senior, I'll get going.

638
31:27.460 --> 31:28.590
Go ahead. Take care.

639
31:47.960 --> 31:50.550
W-What did you want to see me about?

640
31:54.750 --> 31:55.750
Wasn't that drone

641
31:57.480 --> 31:58.420
for me?

642
32:02.090 --> 32:02.700
No.

643
32:06.950 --> 32:07.610
I've got something to do.

644
32:07.610 --> 32:08.670
I should get going.

645
32:25.610 --> 32:26.940
I want to give this drone

646
32:27.610 --> 32:28.810
to someone

647
32:28.810 --> 32:30.010
very important to me.

648
32:50.980 --> 32:52.710
Haven't you finished work yet?

649
32:53.640 --> 32:54.500
What about you?

650
32:54.870 --> 32:55.850
Not for a while.

651
34:22.800 --> 34:25.610
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

652
34:26.360 --> 34:29.010
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

653
34:29.810 --> 34:32.219
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

654
34:32.239 --> 34:35.440
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

655
34:36.350 --> 34:39.440
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

656
34:39.940 --> 34:42.100
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

657
34:42.360 --> 34:45.400
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

658
34:46.100 --> 34:49.400
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

659
34:50.969 --> 34:53.900
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

660
34:53.920 --> 34:56.080
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

661
34:57.960 --> 35:00.910
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

662
35:00.930 --> 35:03.220
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

663
35:04.300 --> 35:07.870
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

664
35:08.040 --> 35:10.900
♪ To meet the moon ♪

665
35:10.930 --> 35:13.860
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

666
35:13.880 --> 35:16.770
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

667
35:16.800 --> 35:20.960
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

668
35:21.280 --> 35:24.150
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

669
35:22.230 --> 35:22.900
Yun Li.

670
35:24.260 --> 35:28.000
♪ Love gives us all ♪

671
35:28.020 --> 35:31.080
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

672
35:31.100 --> 35:31.920
♪ You know ♪

673
35:31.940 --> 35:35.180
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

674
35:35.200 --> 35:38.010
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

675
35:35.840 --> 35:36.500
Yun Li.

676
35:38.040 --> 35:41.620
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

677
35:42.510 --> 35:47.410
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

678
35:47.800 --> 35:48.570
Yun Lili.

679
35:59.040 --> 36:02.310
♪ Practice the poem of love time and again ♪

680
36:02.340 --> 36:05.740
♪ Where should I begin with these soft and low whispers? ♪

681
36:05.760 --> 36:08.900
♪ The moonlight is gently cast upon your name ♪

682
36:07.170 --> 36:09.280
Did you just call my name?

683
36:08.920 --> 36:13.120
♪ I look up, and you're always there, so tenderly ♪

684
36:10.460 --> 36:11.390
You were asleep.

685
36:13.370 --> 36:15.820
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

686
36:14.820 --> 36:16.480
What's up?

687
36:15.850 --> 36:18.480
♪ Through ceaseless tides that ebb and flow ♪

688
36:18.820 --> 36:19.940
I'm about to head out.

689
36:19.940 --> 36:21.480
I saw the lights were still on in here.

690
36:19.940 --> 36:22.440
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

691
36:22.460 --> 36:25.850
♪ As we feel the changes of seasons ♪

692
36:26.430 --> 36:30.000
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

693
36:30.170 --> 36:33.030
♪ To meet the moon ♪

694
36:31.510 --> 36:32.170
Ready to go?

695
36:33.060 --> 36:35.740
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

696
36:35.760 --> 36:38.900
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

697
36:35.780 --> 36:36.510
You want me

698
36:36.610 --> 36:37.730
to go with you?

699
36:39.070 --> 36:43.230
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

700
36:40.920 --> 36:42.630
I can get home on my own.

701
36:43.420 --> 36:46.290
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

702
36:44.110 --> 36:45.110
It's not very safe

703
36:45.710 --> 36:46.530
out there lately.

704
36:46.390 --> 36:50.130
♪ Love gives us all ♪

705
36:48.380 --> 36:50.150
I'm waiting for a file from a coworker.

706
36:50.150 --> 36:53.210
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

707
36:50.260 --> 36:51.590
You go ahead.

708
36:53.330 --> 36:54.150
♪ You know ♪

709
36:54.180 --> 36:57.420
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

710
36:57.440 --> 37:00.250
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

711
37:00.280 --> 37:03.860
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

712
37:04.750 --> 37:10.570
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

713
38:13.560 --> 38:14.870
Why are you still here?

714
38:15.420 --> 38:16.620
I was waiting for you.

715
38:19.340 --> 38:19.900
Let's go.

716
38:20.860 --> 38:21.420
Okay.

717
38:55.450 --> 38:57.030
Am I walking too fast?

718
39:15.540 --> 39:16.630
Have you not had dinner yet?

719
39:16.630 --> 39:17.320
No.

720
39:17.440 --> 39:18.210
Actually, tonight, I...

721
39:18.210 --> 39:19.690
I know you have things to do.

722
39:19.690 --> 39:20.070
It's okay.

723
39:20.070 --> 39:20.940
Just take care of your own stuff.

724
39:20.940 --> 39:21.980
Don't worry about me.

725
39:21.980 --> 39:22.400
I...

726
39:22.400 --> 39:23.320
The guesthouse is just up ahead.

727
39:23.320 --> 39:24.320
I'm almost there.

728
39:24.320 --> 39:24.920
Bye-bye.

729
39:47.380 --> 39:48.180
Good evening,

730
39:48.320 --> 39:49.110
Shize.

731
39:50.420 --> 39:51.110
I feel like

732
39:51.110 --> 39:53.040
I've regained a lot more memories.

733
39:53.110 --> 39:55.170
Was it you who helped me get them back?

734
39:55.360 --> 39:56.150
Yeah.

735
40:02.380 --> 40:03.180
What's wrong?

736
40:04.130 --> 40:05.460
Something on your mind?

737
40:10.820 --> 40:11.610
Yuan,

738
40:13.620 --> 40:14.620
remember the girl

739
40:15.760 --> 40:16.610
I told you about

740
40:16.610 --> 40:17.510
last time?

741
40:17.570 --> 40:18.380
Yup, I do.

742
40:19.420 --> 40:20.280
How's it going?

743
40:20.670 --> 40:22.070
Are you two together now?

744
40:25.610 --> 40:26.420
Not yet.

745
40:26.570 --> 40:27.460
Still not?

746
40:28.480 --> 40:30.340
Don't tell me you still don't know

747
40:30.860 --> 40:33.190
how to win a girl over, just like back then.

748
40:34.550 --> 40:35.610
You got that right.

749
40:37.550 --> 40:38.710
She's the girl

750
40:39.150 --> 40:40.110
who played robot soccer

751
40:40.110 --> 40:40.880
back then.

752
40:41.610 --> 40:42.540
Wait, it was her?

753
40:43.490 --> 40:44.790
You were already

754
40:44.810 --> 40:46.670
so into her back then, weren't you?

755
40:46.670 --> 40:48.570
You were clearly smitten with her,

756
40:48.570 --> 40:50.850
yet you still made me deliver that little soccer ball to her.

757
40:50.850 --> 40:52.050
If you'd confessed

758
40:52.380 --> 40:53.650
your feelings sooner,

759
40:53.650 --> 40:54.320
you wouldn't

760
40:54.320 --> 40:56.850
be dealing with all these complications now.

761
40:57.630 --> 40:58.420
Yeah.
